{"availability":"available","full":"Schromeo/SledTrace","name":"SledTrace","description":"A local-first visual debugger for RAG pipelines.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-14T08:38:39Z","updated":"2026-10-02T21:31:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A local debugger for RAG pipelines. When your app gives a wrong answer, SledTrace shows you why: what the retriever returned, what the model was given, what it said, and where those disagree.","Everything runs on your machine. No account, no API key, nothing uploaded.","Named after my husky. A RAG pipeline is like a sled team: retrievers, rerankers and LLMs all pulling together. When the sled goes off course, you read the tracks in the snow to find out which dog stumbled. SledTrace shows you the tracks."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Schromeo/SledTrace/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e3c61f51c57c9e3fa11878f868a5d71b71f56a76a2dc3f9888f0e999d912f260","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:51.744Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A local debugger for RAG pipelines. When your app gives a wrong answer, SledTrace shows you why: what the retriever returned, what the model was given, what it said, and where those disagree.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Schromeo/SledTrace/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account, no API key, nothing uploaded.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Schromeo/SledTrace/blob/main/README.md"}],"fin